✖︎ `AdCampaignGroup` implements the server interface `CampaignGroup` and serves `ad_object_id` with its own resolver, which only exec time reads: the executor computes it when the query runs. `CampaignQuery` reaches this selection through the root fragment of `outer_label` and runs at read time, where an object of `AdCampaignGroup` would have no `ad_object_id`. Move `outer_label` into a fragment and select it there under `@include(if: $__relay_exec_time)`, add `@exec_time_resolvers` without `enabledProvider` to `CampaignQuery`, or select this inside `... on` the server types.

